{"id":"227d50593617335f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility.md","title":"ZFC Recursion3 Enumeration Reducibility","display":"df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility — ZFC Recursion3 Enumeration Reducibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility — ZFC Recursion3 Enumeration Reducibility","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility — ZFC Recursion3 Enumeration Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3ba8a592901203c\" href=\"?note=c3ba8a592901203c\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3ba8a592901203c\" href=\"?note=c3ba8a592901203c\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationReducibility}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationReducibility}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nA,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists W,\\Phi\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S(W,\\Phi)\\land A=\\Phi(B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nA,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists W,\\Phi\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S(W,\\Phi)\\land A=\\Phi(B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enumeration reducibility is witnessed by a genuine enumeration operator; its upstream definition already enforces finite positive information and c.e. coding.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3ba8a592901203c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3ba8a592901203c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-operator.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationReducibility}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion3\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}reducibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationReducibility}_S(A,B)\\leftrightarrow\nA,B\\subseteq\\omega\\land\n\\exists W,\\Phi\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3EnumerationOperator}_S(W,\\Phi)\\land A=\\Phi(B)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1142,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility.md|58-df-zfc-recursion3-enumeration-reducibility]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["c3ba8a592901203c"]}